From 8874483d347db96bc5b342e75ce901401da26d9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:26:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Games] Show every achievement being attempted

RetroAchievements testers found that with more than one achievement
primed, only the first was shown in the corner, and the achievements
list didn't say which ones were being attempted.

RetroPlayer.AchievementsChallengeTitle and AchievementsChallengeBadge
now take an attempt's place, counted from 1, and Estuary shows up to
three, which still fit with the progress and leaderboard cards. A row of
the achievements list whose achievement is being attempted gets the
achievement.attempting property, which Estuary shows as "Attempt
active".
